Aerie-Purpose: Put the Density and Side radio groups in the Sidebar section of Settings, let the settings page write their prefs, and give the page its strings.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/resources/settings (appearance_page/appearance_layout_page.ts, appearance_page/appearance_layout_page.html.ts, BUILD.gn), chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings (settings_localized_strings_provider.cc), chrome/browser/extensions/api/settings_private (prefs_util.cc)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #184. The rows, settings-aerie-density-row and settings-aerie-side-row, are Lit elements in the overlay
(chrome/browser/resources/settings/appearance_page/aerie_density_row.* and aerie_side_row.*). Each is a settings-radio-group on
aerie.sidebar.density (comfortable, compact, rail, auto-hide) or aerie.sidebar.side (left, right), both strings registered by
components/aerie_sidebar/aerie_sidebar_prefs.cc. The pref names are string literals in the settings_private allowlist, as for the other
Aerie prefs, and a test compares them with the constants. Their strings are in the overlay aerie_sidebar_strings.grdp.

--- a/chrome/browser/extensions/api/settings_private/prefs_util.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/extensions/api/settings_private/prefs_util.cc
@@ -495,6 +495,10 @@
   // The name is aerie_tab_model::kFolderRulesEnabled; a test compares the two.
   (*s_allowlist)["aerie.folders.rules_enabled"] =
       settings_api::PrefType::kBoolean;
+  // Aerie: the sidebar's density and side (issue #184). The names are
+  // aerie_sidebar::kDensityPref and kSidePref; a test compares them.
+  (*s_allowlist)["aerie.sidebar.density"] = settings_api::PrefType::kString;
+  (*s_allowlist)["aerie.sidebar.side"] = settings_api::PrefType::kString;
   // Aerie: the sidebar's width and shown state (issue #177). The names are
   // aerie_sidebar::kWidthPref and kVisiblePref; a test compares them. The
   // layout pref is not here until issue #186 builds the second layout.
--- a/chrome/browser/resources/settings/appearance_page/appearance_layout_page.html.ts
+++ b/chrome/browser/resources/settings/appearance_page/appearance_layout_page.html.ts
@@ -13,6 +13,8 @@
   <settings-aerie-sleep-row></settings-aerie-sleep-row>
   <settings-aerie-pinned-close-row></settings-aerie-pinned-close-row>
   <settings-aerie-folder-rules-row></settings-aerie-folder-rules-row>
+  <settings-aerie-density-row></settings-aerie-density-row>
+  <settings-aerie-side-row></settings-aerie-side-row>
 </settings-section>
 <!--_html_template_end_-->`;
